      "reviewer_name": "Anonymous",
      "rating": null,
      "title": "",
      "review_text": "I bought this because the push button umbrellas are impossible to do if you are short (5'1\") and a senior citizen. Random thoughts: I have no problem cranking this up or down... After many hours of trying to assemble this, we gave up and paid our handyman to do it. He came with a helper, and between the 2 of them, they figured it out -- but even they had trouble with the instructions... I only rated it 4 stars because you can't really angle it to block out the sun, so get one large enough to give you plenty of coverage... You must also order a base for it. Be sure to already have the base before you assemble it... We have had a lot of rain and the umbrella hasn't gotten moldy even when the umbrella has been fully closed. The beige color keeps it from being too dark under the umbrella.",
